&lt;h2 style=&quot;color: #166534; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px;&quot;&gt;Booking Created Successfully!&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: #374151; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 12px;&quot;&gt;The Booking record has been linked to this Opportunity and the Booked Unit status has been set to &lt;b style=&quot;color: #D97706;&quot;&gt;Under Offer&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top: 16px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;/lightning/r/Booking__c/{!varCreatedBookingId}/view&quot; target=&quot;_top&quot; style=&quot;display: inline-block; padding: 10px 20px; background-color: #0070D2; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px;&quot;&gt;View Created Booking Record&lt;/a&gt;
